       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8285187b23d5d8ea87a1ecc2e6d456d6?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8285187b23d5d8ea87a1ecc2e6d456d6?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8285187b23d5d8ea87a1ecc2e6d456d6?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBB-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Bill Branan",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5d83b5f927bbf40c2c32ceeb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>\n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-391\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-391\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Update the REST API to support the new Administrative Client\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-391\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n introduces a new verb for retrieving datastream content, in order to allow a datastream's \"profile\" to also be available. The datastream profile includes the information provided by APIM.getDatastream. The profile will be available at the url <a href=\"http://host:port/fedora/objects/PID/datastreams/DSID\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://host:port/fedora/objects/PID/datastreams/DSID</a>, appending /content to this url will return the datastream contents.</p>",
     "created": "19/Feb/09 10:50 AM",
     "id": "10834",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10412/comment/10834",
